      "type": "ContributingFactor"
    },
    {
      "id": "Iarnr\u00f3d \u00c9ireann did not notice that the Alsetex fog signals provided to them were not the Lacroix fog signals that were ordered",
      "type": "ContributingFactor"
    },
    {
      "id": "The fog signals storage tube, designed by Iarnr\u00f3d \u00c9ireann, allowed the fog signals to impact on one another which may have caused them to degrade over time",
      "type": "ContributingFactor"
    },
    {
      "id": "Iarnr\u00f3d \u00c9ireann did not risk assess the storage and transportation of fog signals outside of Central Stores",
      "type": "SystemicFactor"
    },
    {
      "id": "Iarnr\u00f3d \u00c9ireann had not introduced any training to staff in the handling of fog signals",
      "type": "SystemicFactor"
    },
    {
      "id": "Iarnr\u00f3d \u00c9ireann did not have a process in place for the checking of parts when they arrive at Central Stores",
      "type": "SystemicFactor"
    }
